{"id":"en_blossom-in-the-wind","title":"Blossom In The Wind","titleEn":"Blossom In The Wind","description":"Tang Mujuan was raised by her mother alone and has a remarkable gift for fashion design. Her talent draws the notice of Du Hanfeng, a prominent local fashion figure, at her graduation design competition. Impressed by her abilities and struck by her resemblance to his first love, he invites her to take part in a contest run by his company, where the top three finishers can join leading fashion houses. His wife, Du Manzhi, grows jealous and arranges for people to harass Tang Mujuan, but Gu Zhixiu arrives in time to rescue her. Tang Mujuan later enters a prestigious fashion competition and succeeds despite the obstacles in her path. She then learns that her mother, Tang Xuelan, has been in a car accident and hurries to the hospital. Before dying, Tang Xuelan reveals that Tang Mujuan is Du Han","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/blossom-in-the-wind/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/blossom-in-the-wind/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d523m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_blossom-in-the-wind_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d523m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_blossom-in-the-wind_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d523m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_blossom-in-the-wind_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d523m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":